","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"数分……前、からだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"あの、戦士たちは……賞賛に、値する……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"……ふん……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"――体調には、気をつけろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"お前の、状態は……理想的とは、呼べない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"言われずともわかっている。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたは自分の仕事に集中していてくれ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"……私はロドスを追跡する。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我々は、奴らを掃討してはじめて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フロストノヴァ","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門へと赴くことができるのだからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ふぅ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……はぁ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"もうすぐ……撤退用のポイントに、到着します。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクター、私たちは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤ！　近衛局と通信が繋がったわ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メテオリーテ","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"緊急連絡よ！"},